   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Socialmedicin  04-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att:  - utbilda PhD och master studenter  - utf&#xf6;ra tv&#xe4;rvetenskaplig forskning   - uteckla ett h&#xe4;lso och samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaplist laboratorium - att utvecklia ett dator laboratorium f&#xf6;r doktorander - att utveckla syd-syd-nord samarbete</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are to:  - Train doctoral and masters students  - To carry out multi-disciplinary research  - To develop a health and social science research laboratory - To develop a computer laboratory for research students  - To develop South-South-North collaboration</narrative>
